WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.800
Her name's Rose McNulty,

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.800
I did not kill my child

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.800
We just need this woman to be reassessed so we can move her to the new facility

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.949
Rose I want to hear your story

00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:29.509
1942

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:36.529
When the war came to Belfast out of the sky he came

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:37.440
Over here

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:39.180
We have to go

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.660
You'd better hide

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.160
Open up

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.200
Tell me where he is

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:51.040
You need to be careful whose side you take with us or with the Brits

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.160
It was like stepping into a fairy tale

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.320
You're not from around here are you? Are you a policeman?

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.620
I'm pregnant.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:04.600
she was in the car with the priest you know

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:06.980
they're saying it's the priests' baby

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:12.730
What is that?

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:21.740
I committed my memories to my secret Scripture

00:01:26.479 --> 00:01:31.100
Do you not understand the power you have over men

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.780
You're a priest who also wants to be a man.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.358
Make up your mind but leave me out of it

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:42.000
Sexual behavior of an unborn nature

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:42.820
but I haven't done anything

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:44.960
I think we'll keep you here for a while

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.740
She doesn't believe her son's dead

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.480
Rose McNulty

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.340
There's something missing

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.020
I did not kill my child.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.200
Do you think I killed my baby?

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:02.540
Rose!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:11.040
you know there's a sickness in people that stops them seeing the truth

